PROJECT: Ethereum

## System Architecture

- Arsitektur: Layer 1 blockchain modular dengan pemisahan execution layer dan consensus layer (HIGH) [Ethereum.org - Nodes and Clients, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/nodes-and-clients/; Consensus Specs, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs]
- Execution Layer: Menangani transaksi, eksekusi EVM, state management, dan mempool (HIGH) [Execution Specs, https://github.com/ethereum/execution-specs; Ethereum.org - Architecture, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/architecture/]
- Consensus Layer (Beacon Chain): Menangani Proof-of-Stake, validator management, fork choice (Gasper), finality (HIGH) [Consensus Specs - Beacon Chain, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/beacon-chain.md; Ethereum.org - Consensus Layer, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/consensus-mechanisms/pos/]
- Engine API (Engine JSON-RPC): Interface standar antara execution client dan consensus client untuk payload exchange (HIGH) [Engine API Specs, https://github.com/ethereum/execution-apis/blob/main/src/engine; Ethereum.org - Engine API, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/apis/json-rpc/#engine-api]
- Data Availability: On-chain calldata (pre-Dencun) dan blob transactions (EIP-4844 post-Dencun) untuk L2 rollup data (HIGH) [EIP-4844, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4844; Ethereum.org - Dencun, https://ethereum.org/en/upgrades/dencun/]
- Networking: devp2p (execution layer) dan libp2p (consensus layer) untuk P2P gossip dan sync (HIGH) [Devp2p Specs, https://github.com/ethereum/devp2p; Libp2p Specs, https://github.com/libp2p/specs]
- State Storage: Merkle Patricia Trie untuk world state, receipt trie, transaction trie; penyimpanan key-value di LevelDB/RocksDB (HIGH) [Ethereum Yellow Paper, https://ethereum.github.io/yellowpaper/paper.pdf; Geth Database, https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum/tree/master/ethdb]

## Core Components

- Geth (Go-Ethereum): Klien eksekusi referensi dan dominan; fungsi: eksekusi transaksi, state management, JSON-RPC, P2P networking; Status: Production/Active (HIGH) [GitHub go-ethereum, https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum; Client Diversity, https://clientdiversity.org/]
- Besu: Klien eksekusi Java enterprise-grade (Hyperledger); fungsi: eksekusi transaksi, permissioning, privacy, JSON-RPC; Status: Production/Active (HIGH) [Hyperledger Besu, https://www.hyperledger.org/projects/besu; GitHub Besu, https://github.com/hyperledger/besu]
- Nethermind: Klien eksekusi .NET/C#; fungsi: eksekusi transaksi, high-performance, MEV tooling; Status: Production/Active (HIGH) [Nethermind GitHub, https://github.com/NethermindEth/nethermind; Nethermind.io, https://nethermind.io/]
- Erigon: Klien eksekusi Go dengan staged sync; fungsi: arsip node efisien, fast sync, low disk usage; Status: Production/Active (HIGH) [Erigon GitHub, https://github.com/ledgerwatch/erigon; Erigon Tech, https://erigon.tech/]
- Prysm: Klien konsensus Go; fungsi: validator duties, beacon chain, fork choice, sync committees; Status: Production/Active (HIGH) [Prysm GitHub, https://github.com/prysmaticlabs/prysm; Prysmatic Labs, https://prysmaticlabs.com/]
- Lighthouse: Klien konsensus Rust; fungsi: validator duties, beacon chain, formal verification focus; Status: Production/Active (HIGH) [Lighthouse GitHub, https://github.com/sigp/lighthouse; Sigma Prime, https://sigmaprime.io/]
- Teku: Klien konsensus Java; fungsi: validator duties, enterprise focus, Besu integration; Status: Production/Active (HIGH) [Teku GitHub, https://github.com/Consensys/teku; Consensys Teku, https://consensys.net/teku/]
- Nimbus: Klien konsensus dan eksekusi ringan Nim; fungsi: resource-constrained devices, mobile, embedded; Status: Production/Active (HIGH) [Nimbus GitHub, https://github.com/status-im/nimbus-eth2; Status Nimbus, https://status.im/nimbus]
- Lodestar: Klien konsensus TypeScript; fungsi: light client, browser/Node.js, ChainSafe ecosystem; Status: Production/Active (HIGH) [Lodestar GitHub, https://github.com/ChainSafe/lodestar; ChainSafe, https://chainsafe.io/]
- EVM (Ethereum Virtual Machine): Mesin eksekusi Turing-complete; fungsi: smart contract execution, bytecode interpretation, gas metering; Status: Production/Active (HIGH) [Ethereum Yellow Paper, https://ethereum.github.io/yellowpaper/paper.pdf; Ethereum.org EVM, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/evm/]
- Beacon Chain: Konsensus layer PoS; fungsi: validator registry, block proposal, attestation, finality, fork choice; Status: Production/Active since Dec 2020 (HIGH) [Beacon Chain Specs, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/beacon-chain.md; Ethereum.org Beacon Chain, https://ethereum.org/en/upgrades/beacon-chain/]
- Engine API: Interface execution↔consensus; fungsi: payload building, validation, forkchoiceUpdated, newPayload; Status: Production/Active (HIGH) [Engine API Specs, https://github.com/ethereum/execution-apis/blob/main/src/engine; Ethereum.org Engine API, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/apis/json-rpc/#engine-api]
- Blob Storage (EIP-4844): Data availability untuk L2; fungsi: blob transactions, kzg commitments, blob gas market; Status: Production/Active since Mar 2024 (HIGH) [EIP-4844, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4844; Dencun Upgrade, https://ethereum.org/en/upgrades/dencun/]
- Deposit Contract: Bridge staking ETH; fungsi: validator deposit, withdrawal credentials, ETH locking; Status: Production/Active since Nov 2020 (HIGH) [Deposit Contract Address, https://etherscan.io/address/0x00000000219ab540356cBB839Cbe05303d7705Fa; Staking Launchpad, https://launchpad.ethereum.org/]
- Withdrawal Contract (EIP-4895): System-level withdrawal; fungsi: partial/full withdrawal processing, validator exit; Status: Production/Active since Apr 2023 (HIGH) [EIP-4895, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4895; Shanghai Upgrade, https://ethereum.org/en/upgrades/shanghai/]

## Consensus Mechanism

- Nama: Gasper (GHOST + Casper FFG) — Proof-of-Stake berbasis validator (HIGH) [Consensus Specs - Gasper, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/fork-choice.md; Ethereum.org PoS, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/consensus-mechanisms/pos/]
- Validator Set: Dinamis, minimum 32 ETH stake per validator; activation/exit queue; >1 juta validator aktif (2024) (HIGH) [Beaconcha.in Stats, https://beaconcha.in/; Ethereum.org Staking, https://ethereum.org/en/staking/]
- Block Production: Slot-based (12 detik/slot); proposer dipilih via RANDAO + VRF; proposer membangun ExecutionPayload via Engine API (HIGH) [Consensus Specs - Block Proposal, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/block-proposal.md; Ethereum.org Block Production, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/consensus-mechanisms/pos/block-proposal/]
- Attestation: Committee-based voting per slot; LMD-GHOST fork choice; source/target/checkpoint votes untuk finality (HIGH) [Consensus Specs - Attestations, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/attestation-processing.md; Ethereum.org Attestations, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/consensus-mechanisms/pos/attestations/]
- Finality: Casper FFG — checkpoint justified (2/3 supermajority), lalu finalized (2/3 supermajority pada checkpoint berikutnya); ~12.8 menit untuk finality (2 epochs) (HIGH) [Consensus Specs - Finality, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/fork-choice.md#finality; Ethereum.org Finality, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/consensus-mechanisms/pos/finality/]
- Slashing: Penalti untuk double proposal, double attestation, surround vote; ejection + partial stake burn; correlation penalty untuk mass slashing (HIGH) [Consensus Specs - Slashing, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/slashing.md; Ethereum.org Slashing, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/consensus-mechanisms/pos/slashing/]
- Inactivity Leak: Penalty inactivity untuk chain tidak finalized; memastikan liveness recovery (HIGH) [Consensus Specs - Inactivity, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/fork-choice.md#inactivity-leak; Ethereum.org Inactivity Leak, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/consensus-mechanisms/pos/inactivity-leak/]
- Sync Committees: 512 validator per periode (256 epoch) untuk light client verification; dipilih via RANDAO (HIGH) [Consensus Specs - Sync Committees, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/altair/sync-committee.md; Ethereum.org Sync Committees, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/consensus-mechanisms/pos/sync-committees/]
- Proposer-Builder Separation (PBS) / MEV-Boost: Proposer mengoutsourcing block building ke builder via relay; >90% blok melalui MEV-Boost (HIGH) [MEV-Boost Specs, https://github.com/flashbots/mev-boost-specs; Flashbots, https://flashbots.net/; Ethereum.org PBS, https://ethereum.org/en/roadmap/pbs/]
- RANDAO + VRF: Randomness untuk proposer selection dan committee shuffling; RANDAO reveal per epoch (HIGH) [Consensus Specs - RANDAO, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/randao.md; Ethereum.org RANDAO, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/consensus-mechanisms/pos/randomness/]

## Execution Environment

- EVM (Ethereum Virtual Machine): Stack-based, 256-bit word size, Turing-complete bytecode interpreter (HIGH) [Ethereum Yellow Paper, https://ethereum.github.io/yellowpaper/paper.pdf; Ethereum.org EVM, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/evm/]
- Gas Metering: Per-opcode gas cost; base fee (EIP-1559) + priority fee; blob gas market terpisah (EIP-4844) (HIGH) [EIP-1559, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1559; EIP-4844, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4844; Ethereum.org Gas, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/gas/]
- Precompiles: Elliptic curve (ecrecover, bls12-381), hash (SHA256, RIPEMD160, BLAKE2), modular arithmetic, pairing checks (HIGH) [Ethereum Yellow Paper - Precompiles, https://ethereum.github.io/yellowpaper/paper.pdf; EIP-2537, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-2537]
- Transient Storage (EIP-1153): TSTORE/TLOAD opcodes untuk temporary storage dalam transaksi; cleared after transaction (HIGH) [EIP-1153, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1153; Dencun Upgrade, https://ethereum.org/en/upgrades/dencun/]
- EOF (EVM Object Format) — EIP-3540/3670: Versioned bytecode container, code validation, subroutines (RJUMP); Status: Spec finalized, mainnet activation pending Pectra (HIGH) [EIP-3540, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-3540; EOF Specs, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/tree/dev/specs/pectra]
- Account Abstraction (ERC-4337): UserOperation mempool, EntryPoint contract, Paymaster, Bundler; Status: Live on mainnet via smart contracts (not protocol-level) (HIGH) [ERC-4337, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4337; Account Abstraction, https://ethereum.org/en/erc-4337/]
- EIP-7702 (Pectra): EOA temporary code delegation via AUTH/AUTHCALL; native account abstraction path; Status: Spec finalized, devnet testing (HIGH) [EIP-7702, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-7702; Pectra Specs, https://github.com/ethereum/execution-specs/tree/master/src/upgrades/pectra]

