## Development Framework

- Hardhat: Development environment, testing, deployment, local network (HIGH) [Hardhat, https://hardhat.org/; GitHub Hardhat, https://github.com/NomicFoundation/hardhat]
- Foundry: Rust-based toolchain (forge, cast, anvil, chisel); fast testing, fuzzing, cheatcodes (HIGH) [Foundry, https://github.com/foundry-rs/foundry; Foundry Book, https://book.getfoundry.sh/]
- Truffle: Legacy framework, testing, deployment; dikembangkan Consensys (MEDIUM) [Truffle Suite, https://trufflesuite.com/; GitHub Truffle, https://github.com/trufflesuite/truffle]
- Brownie: Python-based framework untuk testing dan deployment (MEDIUM) [Brownie, https://github.com/eth-brownie/brownie]
- Waffle: TypeScript testing library (legacy, digantikan Foundry/Hardhat) (LOW) [Waffle, https://github.com/EthWorks/Waffle]
- ethers.js / viem: Library interaksi Ethereum (RPC, wallet, contract, utils) (HIGH) [ethers.js, https://github.com/ethers-io/ethers.js; viem, https://viem.sh/]
- web3.py: Python library untuk Ethereum JSON-RPC (HIGH) [web3.py, https://github.com/ethereum/web3.py]
- OpenZeppelin Contracts: Library kontrak standar (ERC20, ERC721, Ownable, AccessControl, Upgradeable) (HIGH) [OpenZeppelin Contracts, https://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts; OpenZeppelin Docs, https://docs.openzeppelin.com/contracts/]
- Solmate: Gas-optimized contract library (Rari Capital/Transmissions11) (MEDIUM) [Solmate, https://github.com/transmissions11/solmate]
- Forge Standard Library (forge-std): Testing utilities untuk Foundry (console.log, cheatcodes, vm) (HIGH) [forge-std, https://github.com/foundry-rs/forge-std]
- Slither: Static analysis framework (Trail of Bits) untuk vulnerability detection (HIGH) [Slither, https://github.com/crytic/slither; Trail of Bits, https://www.trailofbits.com/]
- Echidna: Fuzzing/property-based testing untuk smart contracts (Trail of Bits) (HIGH) [Echidna, https://github.com/crytic/echidna]
- Foundry Cheatcodes / Anvil: Local testnet dengan fork mainnet, time travel, state manipulation (HIGH) [Anvil, https://book.getfoundry.sh/reference/anvil/; Cheatcodes, https://book.getfoundry.sh/cheatcodes/]
- Tenderly: Debugging, simulation, monitoring platform (MEDIUM) [Tenderly, https://tenderly.co/]
- Kurtosis: Multi-container testnet orchestration untuk integration testing (MEDIUM) [Kurtosis, https://github.com/kurtosis-tech/kurtosis]

## Security Model

- Validator Economics: 32 ETH minimum stake; slashing conditions (double sign, surround vote); inactivity leak; correlation penalty (HIGH) [Consensus Specs - Slashing, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/slashing.md; Ethereum.org Validator Security, https://ethereum.org/en/staking/validator-security/]
- Fork Choice: LMD-GHOST (Latest Message Driven GHOST) untuk block selection; aman di bawah asumsi synchronous network dan >2/3 honest stake (HIGH) [Consensus Specs - Fork Choice, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/fork-choice.md; Ethereum.org Fork Choice, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/consensus-mechanisms/pos/fork-choice/]
- Finality Gadget: Casper FFG — accountable safety (jika finalized block ditolak, >1/3 stake slashable); plausible liveness (HIGH) [Casper FFG Paper, https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.09437; Consensus Specs - Finality, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/fork-choice.md#finality]
- Randomness: RANDAO (verifiable secret sharing) + VRF untuk proposer selection; biasable tapi unbiasable dengan single secret reveal (HIGH) [Consensus Specs - RANDAO, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/randao.md; Ethereum.org Randomness, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/consensus-mechanisms/pos/randomness/]
- Client Diversity: 5+ execution clients, 5+ consensus clients; tidak ada client >2/3 market share (target); multi-client testnets (HIGH) [Client Diversity, https://clientdiversity.org/; Ethereum.org Client Diversity, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/nodes-and-clients/client-diversity/]
- Formal Verification: K framework (EVM semantics), Certora, VeriSol, act untuk spec verification; Lighthouse menggunakan formal verification untuk critical paths (HIGH) [KEVM, https://github.com/kframework/evm-semantics; Certora, https://www.certora.com/; Lighthouse Verification, https://github.com/sigp/lighthouse/tree/master/verification]
- Fuzzing: Echidna, Foundry fuzzing, libFuzzer integration di klien (HIGH) [Echidna, https://github.com/crytic/echidna; Foundry Fuzzing, https://book.getfoundry.sh/reference/forge/fuzz; Geth Fuzzing, https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum/tree/master/fuzz]
- Audit Programs: Ethereum Foundation Protocol Security Grants; Immunefi bug bounty ($500k+ max); competitive audits untuk major upgrades (HIGH) [EF Security Grants, https://esp.ethereum.foundation/; Immunefi Ethereum, https://immunefi.com/bug-bounty/ethereum/; Consensus Specs Audits, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/tree/dev/audits]
- MEV Mitigation: PBS (Proposer-Builder Separation), MEV-Boost, builder API, inclusion lists (EIP-7547) untuk censorship resistance (HIGH) [MEV-Boost, https://github.com/flashbots/mev-boost; PBS Roadmap, https://ethereum.org/en/roadmap/pbs/; EIP-7547, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-7547]
- Light Client Security: Sync committees (512 validator) untuk trust-minimized verification; merkle proofs untuk state; ultrasync untuk fast sync (HIGH) [Sync Committee Specs, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/altair/sync-committee.md; Light Client Specs, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/light-client.md]

## Audit History

- Auditor: Trail of Bits; Tanggal: 2016–sekarang (berkelanjutan); Scope: Geth, EVM, consensus specs, EIPs, cryptography; Status: Completed/Ongoing; Source: https://www.trailofbits.com/ ; https://github.com/trailofbits
- Auditor: Sigma Prime; Tanggal: 2018–sekarang; Scope: Lighthouse, consensus specs, beacon chain, networking; Status: Completed/Ongoing; Source: https://sigmaprime.io/ ; https://github.com/sigp/lighthouse/tree/master/audits
- Auditor: Least Authority; Tanggal: 2019–2021; Scope: Geth, libp2p, networking, consensus; Status: Completed; Source: https://leastauthority.com/ ; https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum/security/advisories
- Auditor: NCC Group; Tanggal: 2020–2022; Scope: Beacon chain deposit contract, consensus specs, withdrawal credentials; Status: Completed; Source: https://www.nccgroup.com/ ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2020/11/09/eth2-deposit-contract-audit
- Auditor: Quantstamp; Tanggal: 2020; Scope: Beacon chain deposit contract (0x000...05Fa); Status: Completed; Source: https://quantstamp.com/ ; https://github.com/ethereum/eth2.0-deposit-contract-audit
- Auditor: Consensys Diligence; Tanggal: 2017–sekarang; Scope: EIPs (1559, 4844, 4337), client code, tooling; Status: Completed/Ongoing; Source: https://consensys.net/diligence/ ; https://github.com/Consensys
- Auditor: OpenZeppelin; Tanggal: 2018–sekarang; Scope: ERC standards, upgradeable contracts, EF grants; Status: Completed/Ongoing; Source: https://www.openzeppelin.com/ ; https://github.com/OpenZeppelin
- Auditor: Pashov Audit Group / Spearbit / Code4rena / Sherlock; Tanggal: 2021–sekarang; Scope: Competitive audits untuk major upgrades (Shanghai, Dencun, Pectra), EIP implementations; Status: Completed/Ongoing; Source: https://spearbit.io/ ; https://code4rena.com/ ; https://www.sherlock.xyz/
- Auditor: Ethereum Foundation Protocol Security (Internal + Grants); Tanggal: 2014–sekarang; Scope: Protocol-level review, cryptography, consensus safety, client implementations; Status: Ongoing; Source: https://esp.ethereum.foundation/ ; https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/tree/dev/audits
- Auditor: Immunefi Bug Bounty Program; Tanggal: 2020–sekarang; Scope: Live protocol, clients, smart contracts; Max reward $500k+; Status: Ongoing; Source: https://immunefi.com/bug-bounty/ethereum/

## Technical Upgrade History

- Tanggal: 2015-07-30; Nama Upgrade: Frontier (Genesis); Deskripsi Singkat: Mainnet launch, PoW mining, 72M ETH genesis allocation; Status: Completed; Source: https://blog.ethereum.org/2015/07/22/frontier-is-coming
- Tanggal: 2016-03-14; Nama Upgrade: Homestead (Block 1,150,000); Deskripsi Singkat: First major hard fork, EIP-2/7/8, removed frontier thaw, protocol stabilization; Status: Completed; Source: https://blog.ethereum.org/2016/02/29/homestead-release
- Tanggal: 2016-07-20; Nama Upgrade: DAO Fork (Block 1,920,000); Deskripsi Singkat: Irregular state change to recover DAO funds, created Ethereum Classic split; Status: Completed; Source: https://blog.ethereum.org/2016/07/20/hard-fork-completed
- Tanggal: 2016-10-18; Nama Upgrade: Tangerine Whistle (Block 2,463,000); Deskripsi Singkat: Anti-DoS gas cost increases for IO-heavy ops, state clearing; Status: Completed; Source: https://blog.ethereum.org/2016/10/18/faq-upcoming-ethereum-hard-fork
- Tanggal: 2016-11-22; Nama Upgrade: Spurious Dragon (Block 2,675,000); Deskripsi Singkat: State clearing (~20M empty accounts), EIP-155 replay protection, reduced SSTORE refund; Status: Completed; Source: https://blog.ethereum.org/2016/11/18/hard-fork-no-4-spurious-dragon
- Tanggal: 2017-10-16; Nama Upgrade: Byzantium (Block 4,370,000); Deskripsi Singkat: Metropolis part 1, precompiles for zk-SNARKs, block reward 5→3 ETH, difficulty bomb delay; Status: Completed; Source: https://blog.ethereum.org/2017/10/12/byzantium-hard-fork
- Tanggal: 2019-02-28; Nama Upgrade: Constantinople (Block 7,280,000); Deskripsi Singkat: Metropolis part 2, CREATE2, EXTCODEHASH, bitwise ops, block reward 3→2 ETH; Status: Completed; Source: https://blog.ethereum.org/2019/02/22/ethereum-constantinople-hard-fork
- Tanggal: 2019-12-07; Nama Upgrade: Istanbul (Block 9,069,000); Deskripsi Singkat: BLAKE2 precompile, gas cost adjustments, CHAINID opcode, cheaper calldata for L2; Status: Completed; Source: https://blog.ethereum.org/2019/11/20/istanbul-hard-fork
- Tanggal: 2021-04-15; Nama Upgrade: Berlin (Block 12,244,000); Deskripsi Singkat: Typed transactions (EIP-2718), access lists, gas cost adjustments for state access; Status: Completed; Source: https://blog.ethereum.org/2021/03/08/ethereum-berlin-upgrade-announcement
- Tanggal: 2021-08-05; Nama Upgrade: London (Block 12,965,000); Deskripsi Singkat: EIP-1559 fee market (base fee burn), BASEFEE opcode, reduced refunds, difficulty bomb delay; Status: Completed; Source: https://blog.ethereum.org/2021/07/15/london-mainnet-announcement
- Tanggal: 2021-10-27; Nama Upgrade: Altair (Beacon Chain Epoch 74,240); Deskripsi Singkat: First consensus upgrade, sync committees, inactivity leak adjustments, validator rewards; Status: Completed; Source: https://blog.ethereum.org/2021/10/20/altair-announcement
- Tanggal: 2022-09-06; Nama Upgrade: Bellatrix (Beacon Chain Epoch 144,896); Deskripsi Singkat: Consensus preparation for Merge, fork choice switch to PoS, ExecutionPayload validation; Status: Completed; Source: https://blog.ethereum.org/2022/08/24/bellatrix-announcement
- Tanggal: 2022-09-15; Nama Upgrade: Paris / The Merge (TTD 58750000000000000000000); Deskripsi Singkat: PoW→PoS transition, execution layer Merge, ~90% emission reduction; Status: Completed; Source: https://blog.ethereum.org/2022/09/15/the-merge-is-done
- Tanggal: 2023-04-12; Nama Upgrade: Shanghai / Capella (Block 17,034,870 / Epoch 194,048); Deskripsi Singkat: Staking withdrawals (EIP-4895), PUSH0, reduced initcode gas, SELFDESTRUCT deprecation; Status: Completed; Source: https://blog.ethereum.org/2023/03/28/shanghai-announcement
- Tanggal: 2024-03-13; Nama Upgrade: Dencun / Cancun-Deneb (Block 19,426,587 / Epoch 269,568); Deskripsi Singkat: Proto-Danksharding (EIP-4844 blobs), transient storage, beacon root in EVM, MCOPY; Status: Completed; Source: https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/03/13/dencun-announcement
- Tanggal: 2025 (Target); Nama Upgrade: Pectra / Prague-Electra; Deskripsi Singkat: EIP-7251 (max effective balance 2048 ETH), EIP-7002 (EL-triggerable exits), EIP-7702 (EOA code delegation), EIP-2537 (BLS12-381 precompile), EIP-7549 (per-slot sync committees); Status: Devnet Testing; Source: https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/tree/dev/specs/pectra ; https://github.com/ethereum/execution-specs/tree/master/src/upgrades/pectra ; https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/07/11/pectra-devnet-0

## Current Technical Stack

- Docker: Containerization untuk klien, testnet, CI/CD (HIGH) [Geth Docker, https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum/tree/master/Dockerfile; Prysm Docker, https://github.com/prysmaticlabs/prysm/tree/master/Dockerfile; Ethereum Docker Hub, https://hub.docker.com/u/ethereum]
- Kubernetes: Orchestration untuk validator clusters, RPC providers, staking infrastructure (HIGH) [EthStaker Kubernetes, https://github.com/ethstaker/ethstaker-guides; Prysm K8s, https://github.com/prysmaticlabs/prysm/blob/master/docs/kubernetes.md]
- Rust: Lighthouse, Reth, Foundry, cargo tooling, crypto libraries (arkworks, blst) (HIGH) [Reth, https://github.com/paradigmxyz/reth; Foundry, https://github.com/foundry-rs/foundry; Arkworks, https://github.com/arkworks-rs]
- Go: Geth, Prysm, Erigon, banyak tooling, gRPC/JSON-RPC servers (HIGH) [Geth, https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum; Prysm, https://github.com/prysmaticlabs/prysm; Erigon, https://github.com/ledgerwatch/erigon]
- Java: Besu (Hyperledger), Teku (Consensys), Gradle/Maven build (HIGH) [Besu, https://github.com/hyperledger/besu; Teku, https://github.com/Consensys/teku]
- C#/.NET: Nethermind, .NET 8+, performance-focused (HIGH) [Nethermind, https://github.com/NethermindEth/nethermind]
- Nim: Nimbus, minimal dependencies, embedded targets (HIGH) [Nimbus, https://github.com/status-im/nimbus-eth2]
- TypeScript/JavaScript: Lodestar, Hardhat, ethers.js, viem, web3.js, Next.js dApps (HIGH) [Lodestar, https://github.com/ChainSafe/lodestar; Viem, https://viem.sh/; Hardhat, https://hardhat.org/]
- Solidity: Smart contracts, solc compiler (C++), Yul intermediate representation (HIGH) [Solidity, https://github.com/ethereum/solidity; Solidity Docs, https://docs.soliditylang.org/]
- Vyper: Pythonic smart contract language, formal verification friendly (MEDIUM) [Vyper, https://github.com/vyperlang/vyper]
- Yul: Intermediate language untuk inline assembly, optimizer (HIGH) [Yul Docs, https://docs.soliditylang.org/en/latest/yul.html]
- LevelDB / RocksDB: Embedded key-value store untuk state trie, block storage (HIGH) [Geth Database, https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum/tree/master/ethdb; RocksDB, https://rocksdb.org/]
- libp2p: Consensus layer networking (GossipSub, discovery, DHT) (HIGH) [Libp2p Specs, https://github.com/libp2p/specs; Prysm libp2p, https://github.com/prysmaticlabs/prysm/tree/master/libp2p]
- devp2p: Execution layer networking (RLPx, discovery v4/v5) (HIGH) [Devp2p Specs, https://github.com/ethereum/devp2p; Geth devp2p, https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum/tree/master/p2p]
- gRPC / JSON-RPC: Standard APIs untuk execution (eth_*) dan consensus (beacon_*) endpoints (HIGH) [Execution APIs, https://github.com/ethereum/execution-apis; Consensus APIs, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-apis]
- Prometheus / Grafana: Metrics collection dan visualization untuk validator monitoring (HIGH) [EthStaker Monitoring, https://github.com/ethstaker/ethstaker-guides; Geth Metrics, https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum/tree/master/metrics]
- GitHub Actions / Buildkite / CircleCI: CI/CD untuk klien repos, spec repos, testing (HIGH) [Geth CI, https://github.com/ethereum/go-ethereum/actions; Consensus Specs CI, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/actions]
- Kurtosis: Multi-container integration testing untuk network upgrades (HIGH) [Kurtosis, https://github.com/kurtosis-tech/kurtosis; Ethereum Kurtosis, https://github.com/ethpandaops/kurtosis-ethereum]

## Known Technical Limitations

- Throughput: ~15-20 TPS base layer (simple transfers); ~100-200 TPS dengan blob data (EIP-4844); tidak cukup untuk global-scale tanpa L2 (HIGH) [Ethereum.org Scaling, https://ethereum.org/en/roadmap/scaling/; Dencun Impact, https://www.theblock.co/post/285000/ethereum-dencun-upgrade-live]
- Latency: Slot time 12 detik; finality ~12.8 menit (2 epochs); tidak cocok untuk real-time applications tanpa L2/optimistic confirmation (HIGH) [Consensus Specs - Timing, https://github.com/ethereum/consensus-specs/blob/dev/specs/phase0/beacon-chain.md#time-parameters; Ethereum.org Finality, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/consensus-mechanisms/pos/finality/]
- State Growth: World state terus bertambah (~200GB+ archive); history expiry (EIP-4444) belum live; statelessness roadmap belum tercapai (HIGH) [EIP-4444, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4444; Ethereum.org State Expiry, https://ethereum.org/en/roadmap/state-expiry/; The Verge Roadmap, https://ethereum.org/en/roadmap/verge/]
- Client Diversity Risk: Geth execution client >50% market share historis; Prysm consensus client dominan awal; single-client bug risk (HIGH) [Client Diversity, https://clientdiversity.org/; Ethereum.org Client Diversity, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/nodes-and-clients/client-diversity/]
- MEV / Censorship: PBS/MEV-Boost mengurangi tapi tidak eliminasi MEV; builder censorship (OFAC) pada ~20-30% blok; inclusion lists (EIP-7547) belum live (HIGH) [MEV-Boost Data, https://mevboost.pics/; Flashbots, https://flashbots.net/; EIP-7547, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-7547]
- Validator Centralization: Liquid staking tokens (Lido stETH >25% supply) menciptakan operator concentration; DVT (Distributed Validator Technology) adopsi belum masif (HIGH) [Lido Finance, https://lido.fi/; Rated Network, https://www.rated.network/; DVT, https://obol.tech/]
- Quantum Vulnerability: BLS12-381 signatures (KZG, validator signatures) vulnerable ke quantum; post-quantum roadmap (STARK-based, lattice) masih research phase (HIGH) [Ethereum.org Quantum Resistance, https://ethereum.org/en/roadmap/quantum-resistance/; Vitalik Quantum Post, https://vitalik.eth.limo/general/2023/10/31/quantum.html]
- Solo Staking Barrier: 32 ETH minimum, hardware/uptime requirements, technical complexity; mendorong pooling (HIGH) [Ethereum.org Solo Staking, https://ethereum.org/en/staking/solo/; Rocket Pool, https://rocketpool.net/]
- History Expiry: Full nodes menyimpan seluruh history (~1TB+ archive); EIP-4444 (history expiry) dan Portal Network belum production (HIGH) [EIP-4444, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4444; Portal Network, https://github.com/ethereum/portal-network-specs]
- Gas Limit Constraints: Block gas limit ~30M (dapat di-naikkan validator); membatasi komputasi per blok; blob gas limit terpisah ~6M (HIGH) [Ethereum.org Gas Limit, https://ethereum.org/en/developers/docs/gas/; EIP-4844 Blob Gas, https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4844]

