## Summary

- Architecture: Modular Layer 1 dengan execution layer (EVM, state, mempool) dan consensus layer (Beacon Chain, PoS/Gasper) terpisah, terhubung via Engine API; blob data availability untuk L2 scaling (EIP-4844)
- Core Components: 4 execution clients production (Geth, Besu, Nethermind, Erigon), 5 consensus clients production (Prysm, Lighthouse, Teku, Nimbus, Lodestar), EVM, Beacon Chain, Engine API, Deposit/Withdrawal contracts, Blob storage
- Audit Count: 10+ major auditor entities (Trail of Bits, Sigma Prime, Least Authority, NCC Group, Quantstamp, Consensys Diligence, OpenZeppelin, Spearbit/Code4rena/Sherlock, EF Protocol Security, Immunefi) dengan program berkelanjutan
- Major Upgrade Count: 17 major hard forks/upgrades (Frontier, Homestead, DAO Fork, Tangerine Whistle, Spurious Dragon, Byzantium, Constantinople, Istanbul, Berlin, London, Altair, Bellatrix, Merge/Paris, Shanghai/Capella, Dencun, Pectra-devnet) + 2 testnet launches (Olympic, Kiln)

## Open Threads

- EOF (EVM Object Format) activation timeline: Spec finalized since 2023, target Pectra mainnet 2025, tetapi belum ada activation fork yang pasti
- EIP-4444 (History Expiry) dan Statelessness (Verkle Trees / The Verge): Research mature, implementasi client belum dimulai production; target roadmap "The Verge" tanpa timeline konkrit
- Single-slot finality / Orbit SSF: Research aktif (Justin Drake, EF), mengganti 2-epoch finality; tradeoff complexity vs latency belum diresolusi
- Post-Quantum Cryptography: BLS12-381 vulnerable; STARK-based atau lattice-based replacement research; tidak ada EIP konkrit untuk validator signature migration
- Builder Net / Multiple Concurrent Proposers (MCP): Flashbots SUAVE dan MBC (Multiple Block Proposers) research; censorship resistance vs MEV efficiency tradeoff belum final
- PeerDAS (Peer Data Availability Sampling): Post-Dencun scaling untuk blob throughput >16MB/slot; spec draft, implementation belum dimulai client production
- Execution Layer Triggerable Exits (EIP-7002): Termasuk Pectra, memungkinkan withdrawal credentials 0x01 exit via EL transaction; UX implications untuk solo stakers belum terdokumentasi penuh
- EIP-7702 vs ERC-4337 coexistence: Native EOA delegation (EIP-7702) vs smart contract account abstraction (ERC-4337); migration path dan tooling support belum jelas
- Gas Limit Governance: Validator-set gas limit (EIP-7861 proposal) vs hard-coded limit; dynamic adjustment mechanism diperdebatkan
- Client Diversity Incentives: Tidak ada mekanisme protokol untuk enforce client diversity; social coordination saja; risk tetap jika Geth/Prysm bug kritis